			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				637
			</span></i> (lyr.); of Amphitrite, the Nereids, and Leto, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				6.104
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
